  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_042) achieve high validation accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests avgpool aggregation (instead of transformer) with the same RNA/image encoders and weighted fusion, clarifying whether simpler aggregation reduces training cost without sacrificing accuracy. It balances exploitation of the top-performing RNA/image encoder pair with exploration of aggregation methods, and has a lower estimated cost than transformer-based models."
